     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Try <br></div><div>ggplot(...) + scale_y_discrete(labels=c(&quot;紅衫&quot; = &quot;aaa&quot;, &quot;台北&quot; = &quot;bbb&quot;))</div><div>or <br></div><div><div>ggplot(...) + scale_x_discrete(labels=c(&quot;紅衫&quot; = &quot;aaa&quot;, &quot;台北&quot; = &quot;bbb&quot;))</div></div><br>George Nee於 2019年8月19日星期一 UTC+8上午12時26分04秒寫道：</div>"
